(f)
reservation of site, for new towns, industrial estates/areas and any other large-scale development or project which is
required to be undertaken for the proper development of the region or new town;
(g)
preservation, conservation and development of areas of historical, natural scenery, forest wild life, natural resources and
landscaping;
(h)
preservation of objects, features, structure or places of historical natural, architectural or scientific interest and
educational value;
(i)
